    "id": "cartoon-15",
    "title": "Tram 4 (2024) – Acrylic on Canvas by Honys Torres",
    "category": "Cartoon",
    "description": "“Tram 4” (2024) is a Neo Pop artwork by Venezuelan artist Honys Torres, created as part of the Zürich POP collection. The title derives from the real Tram 4 route, which passes directly by the Wasserkirche, a landmark prominently reinterpreted in the composition. At the center stands a LEGO‑style figure representing Huldrych Zwingli, the Swiss Reformation leader associated with the Grossmünster and a key historical figure in Zürich’s identity . Torres blends this historical reference with pop‑culture characters, luxury branding, comic‑book aesthetics, and graffiti‑inspired motifs, creating a vibrant collision between local heritage and global visual culture. The work reflects her exploration of urban identity, cultural hybridity, and the intersection between tradition and contemporary pop iconography. Medium: Acrylic on canvas Dimensions: 70 × 70 cm Year: 2024",
