    "id": "cartoon-16",
    "title": "Bahnhofstrasse (2024) – Acrylic on Canvas by Honys Torres",
    "category": "Cartoon",
    "description": "“Bahnhofstrasse” (2024) is a Neo Pop artwork by Venezuelan artist Honys Torres, created as part of the Zürich POP collection. The piece reinterprets Zürich’s luxury shopping avenue through a playful yet critical lens, portraying consumer stereotypes, aspirational branding, and the visual culture of high‑end retail. Torres blends cartoon characters, urban symbols, and pop‑culture references to expose the tension between everyday city life and the polished image of exclusivity associated with Bahnhofstrasse. The vibrant, graffiti‑inspired composition reflects her ongoing exploration of contemporary urban identity and the aesthetics of global consumerism. Medium: Acrylic on canvas Dimensions: 70 × 70 cm Year: 2024",
